@startuml
title Client, Rental and Building Agent - Reservation Management

participant "Client Agent" as Client
participant "Rental Agent" as Rental
participant "Building Agent" as Building

== 1. Rent a Room ==

note over Client, Rental
The Client Agent sends a request to reserve a room.
The Rental Agent forwards the request to the
Building Agent responsible for the selected building.
end note

Client -> Rental : RentRequestMessage
activate Rental

Rental -> Building : RentRequestMessage
activate Building

Building -> Building : checkAvailability

alt Room available
    Building -> Building : updateRoomStatus
    Building --> Rental : reservationApproved
    deactivate Building

    note over Rental
    The Rental Agent stores the reservation
    and forwards the reservation details to the client.
    end note

    Rental --> Client : ReservationResponseMessage
else Room unavailable
    Building --> Rental : reservationFailed
    deactivate Building

    note over Rental
    The Rental Agent forwards an error
    indicating that the room is unavailable.
    end note

    Rental --> Client : ErrorMessage
end

deactivate Rental

== 2. Confirm Reservation ==

note over Client, Rental
The Client Agent sends a request containing the reservation UUID.
The Rental Agent checks whether the UUID exists in its storage.
If found, it updates the reservation status to CONFIRMED.
end note

Client -> Rental : ConfirmReservationRequest
activate Rental

Rental -> Rental : updateReservationStatus
Rental --> Client : ReservationConfirmedMessage

deactivate Rental

== 3. Cancel Reservation ==

note over Client, Rental
The Client Agent sends a cancellation request containing the reservation UUID.
The Rental Agent checks whether the UUID exists in its storage.
If found, it forwards the cancellation request to the Building Agent
and updates its own reservation storage.
end note

Client -> Rental : CancelReservationRequest
activate Rental

Rental -> Building : CancelReservationRequest
activate Building

note over Building
The Building Agent updates its room data
to mark the room as available.
end note

Building -> Building : updateRoomStatus
Building --> Rental : cancellationProcessed
deactivate Building

Rental -> Rental : updateReservationStatus
Rental --> Client : ReservationCanceledMessage

deactivate Rental

@enduml
